flowchart LR
  IF[IF: pc_q, BTB+BHT, chọn PC] -->|if_id| ID[ID: giải nén C, decode, regfile]
  ID -->|id_ex| EX[EX: forward, ALU, branch, muldiv]
  EX -->|ex_mem| MEM[MEM: LSU, CSR, trap]
  MEM -->|mem_wb| WB[WB: regfile, counters]
  MEM -. forward .-> EX
  WB -. forward .-> EX
  EX -. sai dự đoán .-> IF
  MEM -. trap/mret/fence.i .-> IF
  ID -. redirect .-> IF
